  {
   "id": "el-0004",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 72,
   "width": 2970.0000000000005,
   "height": 25.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1042,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1049,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1751900000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "32 GPU nodes (256 GPUs). Frontend: Cisco Nexus EVPN-VXLAN, six leaves in three vPC pairs (vPC Fabric Peering) plus a border pair. Backend: rail-optimised OcNOS fabric on UfiSpace S9321-64E, plane 1. Frontend and OOB addresses / ASNs are not assigned yet: <placeholders>.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "32 GPU nodes (256 GPUs). Frontend: Cisco Nexus EVPN-VXLAN, six leaves in three vPC pairs (vPC Fabric Peering) plus a border pair. Backend: rail-optimised OcNOS fabric on UfiSpace S9321-64E, plane 1. Frontend and OOB addresses / ASNs are not assigned yet: <placeholders>.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "el-0005",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1320,
   "y": 128,
   "width": 4301.0,
   "height": 25.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#364fc7",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1056,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1063,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1751900000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "FRONTEND FABRIC   EVPN-VXLAN, THREE VLANs, each its own VRF: <data VLAN> (VRF k8s), <stor-mgmt VLAN> (VRF stor-mgmt), <bastion VLAN> (VRF bastion); anycast gateway per VRF, VNIs <placeholders>, every inter-VRF flow through the firewall. Dual-homing: vPC Fabric Peering on every leaf pair (virtual peer-link over the spines, peer-keepalive over mgmt0). Server ports: native 100G, no breakout.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "FRONTEND FABRIC   EVPN-VXLAN, THREE VLANs, each its own VRF: <data VLAN> (VRF k8s), <stor-mgmt VLAN> (VRF stor-mgmt), <bastion VLAN> (VRF bastion); anycast gateway per VRF, VNIs <placeholders>, every inter-VRF flow through the firewall. Dual-homing: vPC Fabric Peering on every leaf pair (virtual peer-link over the spines, peer-keepalive over mgmt0). Server ports: native 100G, no breakout.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "el-0006",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2300,
   "y": 1612,
   "width": 3201.0000000000005,
   "height": 25.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#d9480f",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1070,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1077,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1751900000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "BACKEND FABRIC, PLANE 1   rail optimised: GPU NIC N of every node lands on rail leaf N. Same rail = L2 on the leaf (VLAN N0). Cross rail = leaf > spine > leaf over ROUTED links: eBGP + BFD on every uplink, ECMP over 16 uplinks (4 spines x 4), RoCEv2, PFC + ECN (production switch config), MTU 9216.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "BACKEND FABRIC, PLANE 1   rail optimised: GPU NIC N of every node lands on rail leaf N. Same rail = L2 on the leaf (VLAN N0). Cross rail = leaf > spine > leaf over ROUTED links: eBGP + BFD on every uplink, ECMP over 16 uplinks (4 spines x 4), RoCEv2, PFC + ECN (production switch config), MTU 9216.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
