   "updated": 1751900000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "fw: firewall, eBGP AS <fw-asn>\nhandoff to fe-border1/2: one dot1q\nsub-interface + eBGP session per VRF:\nzones data, stor-mgmt, bastion\nOOB gateway (zone oob)\noriginates each VRF's default route (type-5),\nall inter-VRF policy",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "fw: firewall, eBGP AS <fw-asn>\nhandoff to fe-border1/2: one dot1q\nsub-interface + eBGP session per VRF:\nzones data, stor-mgmt, bastion\nOOB gateway (zone oob)\noriginates each VRF's default route (type-5),\nall inter-VRF policy",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
