  {
   "id": "el-0121",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1020,
   "y": 818,
   "width": 343.20000000000005,
   "height": 75.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2680,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 2687,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1751900000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "6 control nodes + 1 bastion: 2 x 100G each,\none leg per leaf, LACP bond0 as a vPC. ctrl1-6 in\n<data VLAN> (VRF k8s), the bastion in <bastion VLAN>\n(VRF bastion). kube API VIP, Gateway VIP, LB pool:\ntop of the data subnet (ADDRESS PLAN).",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "6 control nodes + 1 bastion: 2 x 100G each,\none leg per leaf, LACP bond0 as a vPC. ctrl1-6 in\n<data VLAN> (VRF k8s), the bastion in <bastion VLAN>\n(VRF bastion). kube API VIP, Gateway VIP, LB pool:\ntop of the data subnet (ADDRESS PLAN).",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "el-0122",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1760,
   "y": 818,
   "width": 320.65000000000003,
   "height": 82.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2694,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 2701,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1751900000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Pure Storage FlashBlade, 2 PB (appliance pair):\n4 x 100G per appliance, 8 x 100G in ONE LACP bond\n(vPC), <data VLAN> TAGGED, 2 links per appliance to\neach control leaf. Management: 1 port per appliance\nto its own control leaf, unbonded, <stor-mgmt VLAN>\n(VRF stor-mgmt), 1G: QSA + 1000BASE-T in a 100G port.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Pure Storage FlashBlade, 2 PB (appliance pair):\n4 x 100G per appliance, 8 x 100G in ONE LACP bond\n(vPC), <data VLAN> TAGGED, 2 links per appliance to\neach control leaf. Management: 1 port per appliance\nto its own control leaf, unbonded, <stor-mgmt VLAN>\n(VRF stor-mgmt), 1G: QSA + 1000BASE-T in a 100G port.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
