   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1751900000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "rail  leaf      AS     loopback      VLAN  subnet          gateway      node n           gpu1         gpu32\n1     be-leaf1  65201  192.168.1.1    10    172.16.1.0/24   172.16.1.1   172.16.1.(10+n)  172.16.1.11  172.16.1.42\n2     be-leaf2  65202  192.168.1.2    20    172.16.2.0/24   172.16.2.1   172.16.2.(10+n)  172.16.2.11  172.16.2.42\n3     be-leaf3  65203  192.168.1.3    30    172.16.3.0/24   172.16.3.1   172.16.3.(10+n)  172.16.3.11  172.16.3.42\n4     be-leaf4  65204  192.168.1.4    40    172.16.4.0/24   172.16.4.1   172.16.4.(10+n)  172.16.4.11  172.16.4.42\n5     be-leaf5  65205  192.168.1.5    50    172.16.5.0/24   172.16.5.1   172.16.5.(10+n)  172.16.5.11  172.16.5.42\n6     be-leaf6  65206  192.168.1.6    60    172.16.6.0/24   172.16.6.1   172.16.6.(10+n)  172.16.6.11  172.16.6.42\n7     be-leaf7  65207  192.168.1.7    70    172.16.7.0/24   172.16.7.1   172.16.7.(10+n)  172.16.7.11  172.16.7.42\n8     be-leaf8  65208  192.168.1.8    80    172.16.8.0/24   172.16.8.1   172.16.8.(10+n)  172.16.8.11  172.16.8.42\nspines be-spine1..4: AS 65200, loopbacks 192.168.100.1..4. Every leaf in its own AS (65201..65208): eBGP, max-paths ebgp 64, fall-over bfd.\nuplinks: BGP unnumbered per routed link (`bgp unnumbered-mode`, `neighbor ethernetN peergroup IPV4_UNDERLAY`).",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "rail  leaf      AS     loopback      VLAN  subnet          gateway      node n           gpu1         gpu32\n1     be-leaf1  65201  192.168.1.1    10    172.16.1.0/24   172.16.1.1   172.16.1.(10+n)  172.16.1.11  172.16.1.42\n2     be-leaf2  65202  192.168.1.2    20    172.16.2.0/24   172.16.2.1   172.16.2.(10+n)  172.16.2.11  172.16.2.42\n3     be-leaf3  65203  192.168.1.3    30    172.16.3.0/24   172.16.3.1   172.16.3.(10+n)  172.16.3.11  172.16.3.42\n4     be-leaf4  65204  192.168.1.4    40    172.16.4.0/24   172.16.4.1   172.16.4.(10+n)  172.16.4.11  172.16.4.42\n5     be-leaf5  65205  192.168.1.5    50    172.16.5.0/24   172.16.5.1   172.16.5.(10+n)  172.16.5.11  172.16.5.42\n6     be-leaf6  65206  192.168.1.6    60    172.16.6.0/24   172.16.6.1   172.16.6.(10+n)  172.16.6.11  172.16.6.42\n7     be-leaf7  65207  192.168.1.7    70    172.16.7.0/24   172.16.7.1   172.16.7.(10+n)  172.16.7.11  172.16.7.42\n8     be-leaf8  65208  192.168.1.8    80    172.16.8.0/24   172.16.8.1   172.16.8.(10+n)  172.16.8.11  172.16.8.42\nspines be-spine1..4: AS 65200, loopbacks 192.168.100.1..4. Every leaf in its own AS (65201..65208): eBGP, max-paths ebgp 64, fall-over bfd.\nuplinks: BGP unnumbered per routed link (`bgp unnumbered-mode`, `neighbor ethernetN peergroup IPV4_UNDERLAY`).",
