   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "RAIL LEAF PORT MAP (identical on all 8 leaves)",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "el-1107",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 816,
   "y": 1235,
   "width": 1058.3999999999999,
   "height": 245.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 16484,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 16491,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1751900000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "`port ethernetP breakout 2X400g`: the two 400G legs P/1 and P/2 of one 800G port go to TWO DIFFERENT servers.\ngpu n  >  ethernet floor((n-1)/2) / (1 if n is odd, 2 if n is even)\n\neth0/1  gpu1   eth0/2  gpu2     eth1/1  gpu3   eth1/2  gpu4     eth2/1  gpu5   eth2/2  gpu6     eth3/1  gpu7   eth3/2  gpu8 \neth4/1  gpu9   eth4/2  gpu10    eth5/1  gpu11  eth5/2  gpu12    eth6/1  gpu13  eth6/2  gpu14    eth7/1  gpu15  eth7/2  gpu16\neth8/1  gpu17  eth8/2  gpu18    eth9/1  gpu19  eth9/2  gpu20    eth10/1 gpu21  eth10/2 gpu22    eth11/1 gpu23  eth11/2 gpu24\neth12/1 gpu25  eth12/2 gpu26    eth13/1 gpu27  eth13/2 gpu28    eth14/1 gpu29  eth14/2 gpu30    eth15/1 gpu31  eth15/2 gpu32\n\nethernet0..15    16 x 800G ports in 2X400g breakout = 32 x 400G, one per GPU node\nethernet16..47   32 x 800G ports free\nethernet48..63   16 x 800G ROUTED uplinks, 4 to each of be-spine1..4, one eBGP + BFD session each. Contiguous block per spine:\n                 eth48-51 > be-spine1    eth52-55 > be-spine2    eth56-59 > be-spine3    eth60-63 > be-spine4\n                 rule: ethernet(48 + 4 x (s-1) + k) > be-spine s, k = 0..3. Mirrors the spine side, which is grouped by leaf.\nspine side       4 x 800G per leaf x 8 leaves = 32 of 64 ports, grouped by leaf (L1 first): ports 4 x (L-1) + k > be-leaf L",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "`port ethernetP breakout 2X400g`: the two 400G legs P/1 and P/2 of one 800G port go to TWO DIFFERENT servers.\ngpu n  >  ethernet floor((n-1)/2) / (1 if n is odd, 2 if n is even)\n\neth0/1  gpu1   eth0/2  gpu2     eth1/1  gpu3   eth1/2  gpu4     eth2/1  gpu5   eth2/2  gpu6     eth3/1  gpu7   eth3/2  gpu8 \neth4/1  gpu9   eth4/2  gpu10    eth5/1  gpu11  eth5/2  gpu12    eth6/1  gpu13  eth6/2  gpu14    eth7/1  gpu15  eth7/2  gpu16\neth8/1  gpu17  eth8/2  gpu18    eth9/1  gpu19  eth9/2  gpu20    eth10/1 gpu21  eth10/2 gpu22    eth11/1 gpu23  eth11/2 gpu24\neth12/1 gpu25  eth12/2 gpu26    eth13/1 gpu27  eth13/2 gpu28    eth14/1 gpu29  eth14/2 gpu30    eth15/1 gpu31  eth15/2 gpu32\n\nethernet0..15    16 x 800G ports in 2X400g breakout = 32 x 400G, one per GPU node\nethernet16..47   32 x 800G ports free\nethernet48..63   16 x 800G ROUTED uplinks, 4 to each of be-spine1..4, one eBGP + BFD session each. Contiguous block per spine:\n                 eth48-51 > be-spine1    eth52-55 > be-spine2    eth56-59 > be-spine3    eth60-63 > be-spine4\n                 rule: ethernet(48 + 4 x (s-1) + k) > be-spine s, k = 0..3. Mirrors the spine side, which is grouped by leaf.\nspine side       4 x 800G per leaf x 8 leaves = 32 of 64 ports, grouped by leaf (L1 first): ports 4 x (L-1) + k > be-leaf L",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
